id: pm-csv-sdk-host-1123
title: Adopt pm-cli 2026.11.23 host-aligned SDK behaviour
description: "Resume the existing SDK migration branch and certify the current published toolchain. Companion item: pm-cli-website-spus."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-23T19:44:23.940Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-23T21:45:51.840Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Classify host-alignment failures and preserve refusal and guard coverage; use transaction-owned finalization for applicable importer batches and prove rollback; run unchanged package gates and record upstream blockers.
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-23T19:44:33.661Z",codex-agent,Resumed the existing migration branch and confirmed all three exact pins match npm latest. Reviewing the installed host contracts and running the complete suite with two workers.
  "2026-11-23T19:49:30.304Z",codex-agent,The preserved callback fix forwards the SDK storage identity from the native item lock. The bounded-dispatch caller assertion passes on the existing workflow pin. The legacy installed-field test passed when child commands used the pinned CLI; the first direct run inherited an older CLI from PATH.
  "2026-11-23T20:19:31.857Z",codex-agent,"The exhaustive run passed 500 admission sequences and 2000 operations. At more than 16 minutes the column model had processed around 100 of 500 cases, so an exhaustive run projected beyond the brief cutoff. The run exposed three failures from command flag validation rejecting undeclared file options. Native dispatch fixtures use positional paths and assert file remains refused. The configured importer partial-failure test still sends a file configuration value to the real registered handler."
  "2026-11-23T20:54:57.433Z",codex-agent,"The PR-tier npm run measured 100% lines, branches and functions. It passed 488 of 489 cases. The remaining schema fixture supplied schema to describe, which never declared that flag. The fixture now proves the host refuses that option and invokes describe, preview and import with their own declared inputs. The malformed-record and no-write assertions remain in place."
  "2026-11-23T21:45:48.676Z",codex-agent,"Final local verification: PR-tier bun run release:check passed 489 of 489 tests, with 100% lines, branches and functions across 13 measured sources. Packed npm and Bun checks passed on the current host, and npm passed on the minimum host. The earlier npm PR-tier run passed 488 of 489 before the schema fixture fix. Three linked commands passed 28 of 28 tests, including the schema rerun. Reverting callback forwarding failed on missing storageId. Reverting positional import input failed with unknown_option. Existing atomic rollback regressions restore original fields after later failures. Lifecycle and source writes already belong to their row operations, so there is no post-batch finalization write to move."
